SUMMARY:The Business Collective: Prepare for What's Next
DESCRIPTION:THE BUSINESS COLLECTIVE  Build Your Network. Explore Your Opt
 ions. Prepare for What's Next.  Designed specifically for pre-business st
 udents\, the Business Collective connects students with upperclassmen\, I
 U alumni\, employers\, and career coaches who can help them navigate the 
 pre-business experience and explore what's possible beyond it.    Each vi
 rtual session offers a different perspective\, giving students access to 
 people who can share candid advice\, expand their understanding of career
  possibilities\, and help them prepare for future opportunities.  DECEMBE
 R 1: PREPARE FOR WHAT'S NEXT    Inside the Recruiter's Room  Find out wha
 t employers really notice.    Step inside the recruiter's perspective and
  hear directly from professionals who evaluate emerging talent. Learn wha
 t helps students stand out and what you can begin doing now—even if you
 're still building experience.  Students will:    Hear what recruiters no
 tice when reviewing early-career candidates.  Learn how campus jobs\, inv
 olvement\, projects\, and other experiences build valuable skills.    Dis
 cover how to communicate their experiences with greater confidence.    Ge
 t practical advice about what they can start doing now to prepare for fut
 ure opportunities.Attend all three sessions to earn a Business Collective
  certificate.
